# About lives in the Settings submenu now (top -> Settings -> About). It shows the LIVE engine
# version (T1.4: lodor_engine --version) + last-sync + library + pending count. The only engine
# call is --version (no network); the info panel renders the resolved version.
desc app menu: Settings -> About -> live version panel via --version
invoke app
config paired
wifi up
engine 0|lodor-sync 9.9.9-test
pick 5
pick 4
pick 255
expect_exit 0
expect_trace PROMPT[Settings]
expect_trace ENGINE --version
expect_trace PANEL mode=auto title='About Lodor'
expect_trace Version 9.9.9-test
